# What `vsce package` leaves out. Only dist/, the grammars, snippets, images and docs ship.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/main.js
!dist/webview/main.css
!dist/icons/*.json
!syntaxes/*.json
!snippets/*.code-snippets
!language-configuration.json
!images/icon.png
!images/icon-light.svg
!images/icon-dark.svg
!walkthrough/*.md
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
